==Skins==
{{Tabber
|Default
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:SentryUnit.png|200px]]
|Black and white quadpod device constructed out of metal, colored black and white.

Has a mounted rifle with red laser to attack enemies.
}}
|Grave Digger
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:GraveDiggerPistolSentry.png|200px]]
|Brown and yellow rudimentary armored sentry located in a coffin.

Has a mounted rifle on the sentry to attack enemies.
}}
|Plushie
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:PlushieSentry.png|200px]]
|Black and white quadpod device constructed out of polyester, colored black and white.

Has a mounted rifle with a yellow screw to attack enemies.
}}
|Phantom
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:PhantomSentry.png|200px]]
|Black and red quadpod device constructed out of metal, colored black and red.

Has a mounted rifle to attack enemies.
}}
|Fallen
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:FallenSentry.png|200px]]
|Grey orb with a blue tip that has a blue crystal in it.

Blue pedestal that it floats above, with multiple grey spikes and grey top and bottom.
}}
|Dark Frost
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:DarkFrostSentry.png|200px]]
|HK416 rifle with an ammo box and a red laser attached to a small green vehicle with black tracks and a grey bulldozer blade.
}}
|Beach
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:BeachSentry.png|200px]]
|Red and white grill with four metal legs.

Has a water gun inside of it to attack enemies.
}}
|Ghost
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:GhostSentry.png|200px]]
|Translucent blue ghost with two black eyes.

Shoots beams from its hands.
}}
|Springtime
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:SpringtimeSentry.png|200px]]
|Green crystal floating above a wooden structure.

Fires beams from the crystal at enemies.
}}
|Bunny
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:BunnySentryUnit.png|200px]]
|Brown, orange and grey quadpod device constructed out of metal.

Has a mounted rifle with yellow laser to attack enemies.
}}
|Scuba Ops
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:ScubaOpsSentry.png|200px]]
|Blue and grey underwater drone with two propellers.

Has a mounted rifle to attack enemies.
}}
}}

