*'''20 December 2024''' - [[v1.47.0|v1.47.1]]
**{{Bugfix}} {{Color|OperationICE|Dark Frost}} now has custom models again.
*'''16 April 2025''' - [[v1.61.0]]
**{{Bug}} Default skin no longer has a muzzle flash.
*'''9 July 2025''' - [[v1.70.0]]
**New skin: {{Color|Surf|Beach}}
**{{Bug}} {{Color|Surf|Beach}} skin has a larger hoverbox.
